   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"880\" data-username=\"ZeptimusQ\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"avatar\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/user_avatar/forum.tecommons.org/zeptimusq/40/135_2.png\" width=\"20\"/> ZeptimusQ:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is this something we want to keep private or transparent to the community?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I feel like unless there’s a reason not to the default for everything should be public.</p>",
